  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are exposed to Islamophobic stereotypes, particularly those who may be influenced by or reinforce the harmful trope that Muslim women wearing hijabs are inherently dangerous or prone to violence. The meme is designed to appeal to or provoke those who are predisposed to fear or hostility toward Muslims, using the contrast between the nun and the Muslim woman to reinforce a prejudiced worldview. It likely targets audiences familiar with or sympathetic to religious or cultural biases, particularly those who view religious head coverings as symbols of threat when associated with Islam but not when associated with Christianity.",
